[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/comments/2992629946","html_url":"https://github.com/iree-org/iree/issues/21155#issuecomment-2992629946","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/21155","id":2992629946,"node_id":"IC_kwDODGgK6M6yX-i6","user":{"login":"monorimet","id":87458719,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NDU4NzE5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87458719?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/monorimet","html_url":"https://github.com/monorimet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monorimet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monorimet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monorimet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monorimet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monorimet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monorimet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monorimet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monorimet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monorimet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-20T19:45:19Z","updated_at":"2025-06-20T19:45:19Z","body":"I was able to minimize further with the following torch IR, which includes a few operations on the norm input tensor that appear in the model:\n```\nmodule @module {\n  func.func @main(%arg0: !torch.vtensor<[1,5120,21,45,80],bf16>) -> !torch.vtensor<[1,75600,5120],bf16> attributes {torch.assume_strict_symbolic_shapes} {\n    %int1 = torch.constant.int 1\n    %int5120 = torch.constant.int 5120\n    %int75600 = torch.constant.int 75600\n    %0 = torch.prim.ListConstruct %int1, %int5120, %int75600 : (!torch.int, !torch.int, !torch.int) -> !torch.list<int>\n    %1 = torch.aten.view %arg0, %0 : !torch.vtensor<[1,5120,21,45,80],bf16>, !torch.list<int> -> !torch.vtensor<[1,5120,75600],bf16>\n    %int1_0 = torch.constant.int 1\n    %int2 = torch.constant.int 2\n    %2 = torch.aten.transpose.int %1, %int1_0, %int2 : !torch.vtensor<[1,5120,75600],bf16>, !torch.int, !torch.int -> !torch.vtensor<[1,75600,5120],bf16>\n    %int1_1 = torch.constant.int 1\n    %int0 = torch.constant.int 0\n    %int5120_2 = torch.constant.int 5120\n    %3 = torch.prim.ListConstruct %int1_1, %int0, %int5120_2 : (!torch.int, !torch.int, !torch.int) -> !torch.list<int>\n    %none = torch.constant.none\n    %none_3 = torch.constant.none\n    %none_4 = torch.constant.none\n    %false = torch.constant.bool false\n    %4 = torch.aten.new_zeros %2, %3, %none, %none_3, %none_4, %false : !torch.vtensor<[1,75600,5120],bf16>, !torch.list<int>, !torch.none, !torch.none, !torch.none, !torch.bool -> !torch.vtensor<[1,0,5120],bf16>\n    %5 = torch.prim.ListConstruct %2, %4 : (!torch.vtensor<[1,75600,5120],bf16>, !torch.vtensor<[1,0,5120],bf16>) -> !torch.list<vtensor>\n    %int1_5 = torch.constant.int 1\n    %6 = torch.aten.cat %5, %int1_5 : !torch.list<vtensor>, !torch.int -> !torch.vtensor<[1,75600,5120],bf16>\n    %7 = torch.prim.ListConstruct %6 : (!torch.vtensor<[1,75600,5120],bf16>) -> !torch.list<vtensor>\n    %int0_6 = torch.constant.int 0\n    %8 = torch.aten.cat %7, %int0_6 : !torch.list<vtensor>, !torch.int -> !torch.vtensor<[1,75600,5120],bf16>\n    %int5120_7 = torch.constant.int 5120\n    %9 = torch.prim.ListConstruct %int5120_7 : (!torch.int) -> !torch.list<int>\n    %none_8 = torch.constant.none\n    %none_9 = torch.constant.none\n    %float9.999990e-07 = torch.constant.float 9.9999999999999995E-7\n    %true = torch.constant.bool true\n    %10 = torch.aten.layer_norm %8, %9, %none_8, %none_9, %float9.999990e-07, %true : !torch.vtensor<[1,75600,5120],bf16>, !torch.list<int>, !torch.none, !torch.none, !torch.float, !torch.bool -> !torch.vtensor<[1,75600,5120],bf16>\n    return %10 : !torch.vtensor<[1,75600,5120],bf16>\n  }\n}\n\n```\nhopefully this leads to a root cause soon.","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/comments/2992629946/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/comments/2992678110","html_url":"https://github.com/iree-org/iree/issues/21155#issuecomment-2992678110","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/21155","id":2992678110,"node_id":"IC_kwDODGgK6M6yYKTe","user":{"login":"monorimet","id":87458719,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NDU4NzE5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87458719?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/monorimet","html_url":"https://github.com/monorimet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monorimet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monorimet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monorimet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monorimet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monorimet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monorimet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monorimet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monorimet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monorimet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-20T20:11:38Z","updated_at":"2025-06-20T20:15:22Z","body":"It seems to be an issue with a transpose on the norm input -- the abort also goes away when I increase --iree-opt-level to O2 or higher. Perhaps we are relying on some advanced fusion techniques or transpose propagations to handle these transposes correctly?","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/comments/2992